:''For the Cat Unit, see [[Healer (Special Cat)]]. Not to be confused with [[Healer (Enemy)]].''
'''Healer Cat''' (にゃんこ化癒術士) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Healer Awakens!]] He was added in [[Version 3.8 Update|Version 3.8]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Healer Cat
|image = E 166.png
|appearance = [[Healer Awakens!]]
|money drop = 1,400¢ - 5,530¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has a very large health pool, but low attack power and mediocre range with a short freeze effect. Not too bad by itself, but it is accompanied with pushers like [[Hearscht (Enemy)|Hearscht]] and it can be a rather annoying support.

